![велотренажер горизонтальный](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0355c64-21de-4fd0-9dff-d7a074d68131)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Before you start your workout, adjust the seat so it fits your height.

### Step 2
Make sure that when your leg is pushed all the way forward, your knee is still slightly bent (do not lock your knees).

### Step 3
Keep your back straight and lean firmly against the backrest.

### Step 4
Choose your workout program. For a standard quick start, simply begin pedaling.

### Step 5
You can also set up the workout manually. You will usually need to enter your age and weight to calculate burned calories. You can change the difficulty level (resistance) at any time.

### Step 6
Hold the handles on the sides of the seat and start pedaling.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
⠀ Do not slide down the seat—keep your back against the backrest.
⠀⠀Keep an eye on your heart rate and maintain steady breathing.
{{< /callout >}}
